# File         : PARAMS.golden_small_incl
# Date         : 11/04/26
# Description  : PARAMS.golden_small with a doubled LLC (3.75 MiB) that is filled on every miss
#                instead of by L2 victims. Everything else is identical to golden_small.
#                Despite the name the LLC is non-inclusive, not inclusive: Scarab does not
#                back-invalidate L2/L1 when the LLC evicts a line (see "Cache hierarchy policy").
# Author       : Surim Oh <soh31@ucsc.edu>
#
# Based on documentation found here:
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Cove
# https://en.wikichip.org/wiki/intel/microarchitectures/golden_cove
# https://www.anandtech.com/show/16881/a-deep-dive-into-intels-alder-lake-microarchitectures/3

